      "slot": "s0",
      "source_id": "b489b87d-8cb3-4074-8a44-d8d6f8ab9a4c",
      "text": "Thanks, I appreciate the support. I'll keep you posted, but if the sky stays cloudy, I might just end up stargazing from my backyard instead. It's not ideal, but I'll make the best of it."
