      "source_id": "9ab241e7-477c-40bd-96dc-405068ddf9c1",
      "text": "Sounds like you have a solid contingency plan! Sometimes the best \"stargazing\" is just enjoying the atmosphere and maybe catching a bit of ambient light or just enjoying the silence of the night, which is a great experience in itself.\n\nLet me know how it goes, or if you decide to try a different location!"
